<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the</p>
<p>third day of the four-day Supersport Series cricket match played</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>In Centurion: Northern Transvaal 334-7 dec (Blaise</p>
<p>Sommerville 62, Dan van Zyl 57, Steve Elworthy 51) and 26-2,</p>
<p>Border 271-5 dec (Piet Botha 62</p>
